$('payDayOffCount').addEventListener('change',()=>{const month=$('payrollMonth').value||monthNow();saveMonthExtras(month,{dayOffCount:Number($('payDayOffCount').value||0),arrears:Number($('payArrears').value||0)});renderPayroll()});
